  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `nuke_build_helpers` from `6.3.16-prerelease.2` to `6.4.0-prerelease.1`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/compare/nuke_build_helpers/6.3.16-prerelease.2...nuke_build_helpers/6.4.0-prerelease.1)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Clean entry logs by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/184\n* Clean `Gh` cli logs by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/185\n* Bump NuGet.Packaging, Nuke.Common, System.Text.Json and YamlDotNet by @dependabot in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/186\n* Bump NuGet.Packaging, Nuke.Common, System.Text.Json and YamlDotNet by @dependabot in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/187\n* Added warning log to empty secret env vars by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/189\n* Bump YamlDotNet from 16.1.3 to 16.2.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/188\n* Bump System.Text.Json from 8.0.5 to 9.0.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/190\n* Bump System.Formats.Asn1 from 8.0.1 to 9.0.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/191\n* Bump NuGet.Packaging from 6.11.1 to 6.12.1 by @dependabot in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/192\n* Bump Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk from 17.11.1 to 17.12.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/193\n* Bump NuGet.Packaging, Nuke.Common, System.Text.Json and YamlDotNet by @dependabot in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/194\n* Cleanup patch for `System.Text.Json` by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/195\n* Updated `global.json` by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/196\n* Added `net9.0` support by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/197\n* Bump YamlDotNet from 16.2.0 to 16.2.1 by @dependabot in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/198\n* Added interactive CLI for local tasks by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/199\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/compare/build.517...build.533",
